      "message": "Merge origin/main into issue/330-pick-to-plane (#341 merged)\n\nBrings in #341's late commits (setup-frame anchors, setup_align\ndescribe/preset_of/angles_of in the app, setup sheet PART ALIGNMENT,\npart_facets message). Clean merge, no conflicts. The plane pick still\nreads its datum in the document frame (the alignment is absolute) and\nlands only through AlignPartToSetup::new; the 3-2-1 reader and the pick\nhighlight keep the active setup's view_pose, as the anchors now do.\n\nRefs #330\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
